msgstr "حقيبة إسعافات أولية"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.PROPGRAVITASFLIPPHONE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.PROPGRAVITASFLIPPHONE.DESC"
msgid "An outdated phone left behind by a distracted lab technician.\n\nIt doesn't work."
msgstr "هاتف قديم تركه فني مختبر مشتت الذهن.\n\nإنه لا يعمل."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.PROPGRAVITASFLIPPHONE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.PROPGRAVITASFLIPPHONE.NAME"
