msgid "<smallcaps>To: <b>Harold P. Moreson, PhD</b><alpha=#AA><size=12> <hmoreson@gravitas.nova></size></color>\nFrom: <b>Dylan Timbre, PhD</b><alpha=#AA><size=12> <principal@brighthall.edu></smallcaps>\n------------------\n"
