msgid "Radiant Bugs emit an extra-bright <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link> in hopes of attracting more of their kind for company.\n\nTheir eggs contain small amounts of <link=\"NATURALRESIN\">Resin</link> that can be harvested when cracked at the <link=\"EGGCRACKER\">Egg Cracker</link>."
