msgstr "<link=\"COOKEDMEAT\">شواء</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDMEAT.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDMEAT.RECIPEDESC"
