#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.FUEL_BRICK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.FUEL_BRICK.DESC"
msgid "A densely compressed brick of combustible material.\n\nIt can be burned to produce a one-time burst of <link=\"POWER\">Power</link>."
