#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.MACHINE_PARTS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.MACHINE_PARTS.DESC"
msgid "Specialized Parts crafted by a professional engineer.\n\n<style=\"KKeyword\">Jerry Rig</style> machine buildings to increase their efficiency."
msgstr "أجزاء متخصصة صنعها مهندس محترف.\n\nقم بـ <style=\"KKeyword\">إصلاح سريع</style> لمباني الآلات لزيادة كفاءتها."

