msgid "<size=16>{Job} Errand Type</size>\n\n{Details}\n\nDuplicants will first choose what <style=\"KKeyword\">Errand Type</style> to perform based on <style=\"KKeyword\">Duplicant Priorities</style>,\nthen they will choose individual tasks within that type using <style=\"KKeyword\">Building Priorities</style> set by the <link=\"PRIORITIES\">Priority Tool</link> {Hotkey/ManagePriorities}"
